---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Support the Work | Liberating Scripture Collective"
  description="Support the Liberating Scripture Collective. Help keep liberation-centered, trauma-informed scripture work free, open, and community-shaped."
  canonical="https://liberatingscripture.org/support/"
>
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <script
      type="application/ld+json"
      set:html={JSON.stringify({
        "@context": "https://schema.org",
        "@type": "WebPage",
        "@id": "https://liberatingscripture.org/support/#webpage",
        url: "https://liberatingscripture.org/support/",
        name: "Support the Work | Liberating Scripture Collective",
        isPartOf: { "@id": "https://liberatingscripture.org/#website" },
      })}
    />
  </Fragment>
  <div class="support-page">
    <!-- HERO -->
    <header class="support-hero">
      <div class="support-hero__inner content">
        <p class="eyebrow">Support the work</p>
        <h1>Help it exist. Help it last.</h1>
        <p class="lede">
          The Liberating Scripture Collective is a small nonprofit devoted to
          scripture that liberates rather than controls. The LIT Bible is our
          biggest endeavor, and the work extends well beyond it. All of it is
          freely available because we believe access is a theological
          commitment. Supporting LSC is what makes that possible.
        </p>
        <div class="support-hero__actions">
          <a href="#donate" class="btn"><span>Donate</span></a>
          <a href="#get-involved" class="btn btn--outline"
            ><span>Get involved</span></a
          >
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="support-content content">
      <!-- DONATE SECTION -->
      <section id="donate" class="support-section">
        <div class="donate-band">
          <div class="donate-band__header">
            <img
              src="/assets/images/lsc-logo.png"
              alt=""
              width="84"
              height="auto"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
              aria-hidden="true"
            />
            <div>
              <h2>Donate</h2>
              <p class="donate-band__sub">
                Via <strong>Give Lively</strong>
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <p>
            Your support keeps LSC and everything it builds free and growing.
          </p>

          <ul class="support-list">
            <li>
              Keeps the sites running and the work accessible to everyone.
            </li>
            <li>
              Funds the translation, the podcast, and the projects being built
              alongside them.
            </li>
            <li>
              Supports the contributors and coordination that make it all
              sustainable.
            </li>
            <li>Makes it possible to keep imagining what comes next.</li>
          </ul>

          <!-- Begin Give Lively Fundraising Widget -->
          <script is:inline>gl=document.createElement('script');gl.src='https://secure.givelively.org/widgets/simple_donation/liberating-scripture-collective.js?show_suggested_amount_buttons=false&show_in_honor_of=false&address_required=false&has_required_custom_question=null';document.getElementsByTagName('head')[0].appendChild(gl);</script>
          <div id="give-lively-widget" class="gl-simple-donation-widget"></div>
          <!-- End Give Lively Fundraising Widget -->

          <div class="donate-band__status">
            <p>
              <strong>501(c)(3) status:</strong> The Liberating Scripture Collective
              is a registered 501(c)(3) nonprofit. Donations are tax-deductible to
              the extent permitted by law.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- GET INVOLVED -->
      <section id="get-involved" class="support-section">
        <h2>Get involved</h2>
        <p>
          Getting involved can mean a lot of things. Some paths require
          expertise; others just require caring about the work. The goal is a
          community where both have a place.
        </p>

        <div class="involvement-grid">
          <article class="involvement-card">
            <h3>Give feedback</h3>
            <p>
              Point out unclear wording, confusing structure, or places where
              the translation needs more transparency. Specific examples help
              most.
            </p>
          </article>
          <article class="involvement-card">
            <h3>Share the work</h3>
            <p>
              If LIT or LSC has been useful to you, share it with people who
              want an honest approach to scripture. Word of mouth is real.
            </p>
          </article>
          <article class="involvement-card">
            <h3>Collaborate</h3>
            <p>
              If you have relevant experience—biblical studies, accessibility,
              design, education, community care—you can help shape the resources
              and how they're built.
            </p>
          </article>
          <article class="involvement-card">
            <h3>Partner thoughtfully</h3>
            <p>
              If you lead a community or program and want to use LIT/LSC
              material responsibly, reach out and we'll talk about what makes
              sense.
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>

        <div class="support-actions">
          <a href="/contact/" class="btn"><span>Get in touch</span></a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  /* Hero */
  .support-hero {
    background: var(--ink);
    color: #c8c6c0;
    padding: clamp(3.5rem, 7vw, 6rem) 0;
  }

  .support-hero__inner {
    max-width: 64ch;
  }

  .support-hero h1 {
    font-family: "Crimson Text", Georgia, serif;
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4.5vw, 3.8rem);
    color: var(--cream);
    margin: 0.75rem 0 1.25rem;
  }

  .support-hero .eyebrow {
    color: #3abf6a;
  }
  .support-hero .lede {
    color: #c8c6c0;
  }

  .support-hero__actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  /* Hero btns on dark bg */
  .support-hero .btn {
    background: var(--green);
    border-color: var(--green);
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .support-hero .btn::before {
    background: var(--cream);
  }
  .support-hero .btn:hover,
  .support-hero .btn:focus-visible {
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .support-hero .btn--outline {
    background: transparent;
    border-color: rgba(200, 198, 192, 0.5);
    color: #c8c6c0;
  }

  .support-hero .btn--outline::before {
    background: rgba(200, 198, 192, 0.15);
  }
  .support-hero .btn--outline:hover {
    color: var(--cream);
  }

  /* Content */
  .support-content {
    padding: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem) 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4rem;
  }

  .support-section h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 2.8vw, 2.2rem);
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
  }

  .support-section p {
    max-width: 68ch;
  }

  /* Donate band */
  .donate-band {
    background: var(--surface-raised);
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .donate-band__header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .donate-band__header h2 {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .donate-band__sub {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #5c5b57;
    margin: 0.25rem 0 0;
  }

  .donate-band__status {
    background: rgba(32, 157, 80, 0.08);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--green);
    border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
  }

  .donate-band__status p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
    max-width: none;
  }

  /* Support list */
  .support-list {
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .support-list li {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* Involvement grid */
  .involvement-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 1.25rem;
    margin: 1.5rem 0 2rem;
  }

  .involvement-card {
    background: var(--surface-raised);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
  }

  .involvement-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
  }

  .involvement-card p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text);
    margin: 0;
    max-width: none;
  }

  .support-actions {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  /* Transparency */
  .support-section--transparency {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding-top: 3rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .involvement-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
